==Battleground==
*6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bun Bun Black's at a decently high magnification, so it wouldn't be a bad idea to burn an anti-Dark Uber here. If you don't anticipate that you're going to be doing much more Labyrinth, [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl/Pizza Cat]] should destroy this level.

